warning[W0512]: offer does not satisfy the exclusion restriction: the path offer ← region → productivity joins it to productivity without passing through training (line 14)
  = help: an instrument may be related to the outcome through the exposure alone: add a regressor that closes the path, or choose another instrument
warning[W1007]: weak instruments: the Cragg–Donald F is 0.44, under 10 (line 16)
  = help: with weak instruments the estimate leans towards the least-squares one and its confidence interval is too narrow; `ar_test()` gives a test and a confidence set that hold however weak the instruments are
warning[W0512]: offer does not satisfy the exclusion restriction: the path offer ← region → productivity joins it to productivity without passing through training and tenure (line 16)
  = help: an instrument may be related to the outcome through the exposure alone: add a regressor that closes the path, or choose another instrument
warning[W0512]: tenure is a descendant of training, so it is no instrument for it (line 17)
  = help: an instrument acts on the exposure and is not acted on by it: what training brings about carries whatever confounds training with productivity
